    <briefdescription>
<para>Citation highlighter: maps answer sentences to source chunks. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Thread-safe: const methods (<computeroutput>highlight</computeroutput>, <computeroutput>splitSentences</computeroutput>, <computeroutput>computeSimilarity</computeroutput>) may be called from multiple threads concurrently. Configuration updates via <computeroutput>setConfig</computeroutput> are guarded by a mutex. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
